 Minimum Operating System version for Tru64 UNIX is v5.1B with Inaugural
  Patch Kit (IPK BL1): T64V51BB1AS0001-20021229.tar.=0D
 Hot Plug on PCI not supported.=0D
 On/Offline of Primary CPU not supported.=0D
 All options supported in a TruClusters environment unless otherwise noted.=
=0D
 TruClusters support requires minimum TruCluster V5.1B TCR 5.1B.=0D
 v5.1B:=0D
  U.S./English keyboards supported, only. (Non-U.S. keyboards are not
  mapped properly.)=0D
=0D
 Does this explain my problem - sort of?

